          "enabled": true,
          "order": 0,
          "props": {
            "body": "ShipFast Conf is the conference we wanted to attend. Single track, so you don't have to choose. Senior engineers only on stage, so the talks have load-bearing detail. Strict 30-minute slots, so the slow-roll product-pitch never happens. We don't sell sponsor talks. We don't run panels. We don't accept submissions from people who don't ship code. Tickets cover the venue, the food, and a small honorarium for every speaker. The rest is on us."
          }
        }
      ],
      "content": {
        "heading": "Why this conference exists",
        "subheading": "A no-fluff alternative to the big-tent AI events"
      }
